comment author Shinryuu
comment Based on publication 4410 and our v3. Wily 4: Leaf Shield sets the stale hitbox types of slots 2-5 to 4 so the Crash Bomb explosions break the Boobeam Trap walls fast (Shinryuu/warmCabin idea, rebuilt by bb43); Wily 5 refights re-synchronised (RNG via capsule-walk subpixels, stale subpixels via Metal Blade timing); 108 frames faster than publication 4410 in total.
